  description: "Phong, h\u1ECFa, \u0111\xE0m, \u1EE9 ngh\u1ECBch l\xEAn che l\u1EA5p
    thanh khi\u1EBFu v\xE0 b\u1EBF t\u1EAFc kinh l\u1EA1c."
